{"title": "Storehouse", "pageid": 8919, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Storehouse", "categories": ["Locations", "Act One Locations"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:StorehouseView.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/StorehouseView.png/300px-StorehouseView.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/StorehouseView.png/450px-StorehouseView.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/StorehouseView.png/600px-StorehouseView.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/StorehouseView.png/300px-StorehouseView.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"194\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/StorehouseView.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  An overview of the Storehouse  </div></figcaption></figure>\n<table class=\"relative-location\" style=\"float:right; width:200px; clear:right;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" class=\"relative-location-header\"><a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:25%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ebonlake_Grotto\" title=\"Ebonlake Grotto\">Ebonlake Grotto</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:7.5%\">←\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%; align-items: center;\"><b>Storehouse</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:7.5%\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center;\">↓\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBnite_Outpost\" title=\"Selûnite Outpost\">Selûnite Outpost</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>The <b>Storehouse</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Location\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Location\">Location</a> within the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/70px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/105px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/140px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/70px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">The Black Network's mark. Spies, murderers, and thieves ahead, I guess.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a>, recognizing the markings on crates<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>The Storehouse is located in the most north-eastern quadrant of the Underdark map. The unnamed area between it and the <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBnite_Outpost\" title=\"Selûnite Outpost\">Selûnite Outpost</a> features bright green grass and whimsical red mushrooms with swirling paths. This part contains two points of possible entering the Underdark. The party can use the elevator from the overland's <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim_Basement\" title=\"Zhentarim Basement\">Zhentarim Basement</a> (which must be unlocked from upside), or land at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;140&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-150</span>, after jumping into the hollow within the <a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Depths\" title=\"Whispering Depths\">Whispering Depths</a> (using means like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall\" title=\"Feather Fall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Feather_Fall_Icon.webp/25px-Feather_Fall_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Feather_Fall_Icon.webp/38px-Feather_Fall_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Feather_Fall_Icon.webp/50px-Feather_Fall_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Feather Fall\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Feather_Fall_Icon.webp/25px-Feather_Fall_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/Feather_Fall_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Feather_Fall\" title=\"Feather Fall\">Feather Fall</a> are necessary to avoid immediate death). Entering the Underdark the latter way grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Outlander#Abyss_Jumper\" title=\"Outlander\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Abyss Jumper\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Outlander#Abyss_Jumper\" title=\"Outlander\">Abyss Jumper</a> inspiration to party members with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Outlander\" title=\"Outlander\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/20px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/30px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/40px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Outlander\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png/20px-Background_Outlander_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Background_Outlander_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Outlander\" title=\"Outlander\">Outlander</a> background.\n</p><p>This area does not have any interactable neutral or allied NPCs.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Zhentarim_storehouse\">The Zhentarim storehouse</span></h3>\n<p>The Storehouse is crammed with various containers, mostly wooden crates and trunks, as well as several locked Rustic Chests, and also one locked and trapped Heavy Chest not far from the elevator. If the storehouse is reached from the other part of the Underdark, any party member can recognize the symbols on the crates at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;141&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-100</span> as belonging to the <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim\" title=\"Zhentarim\">Zhentarim</a> (no Ability check is needed, but if entering the region through the elevator from the Zhentarim Hideout, a different remark is uttered). The area can be looted for a large amount of <a href=\"/wiki/Valuables\" title=\"Valuables\">Valuables</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ammunition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammunition\">Ammunition</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">alchemical</a> resources, <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a> and common weapons.\n</p><p>If the party comes to tne Underdark by any means other than the elevator, unlocked from above, it cannot be used to leave the area.\n</p><p>Approaching the entrance to the storehouse, the party may feel an earthquake. It does no harm, but a random party member comments on it. \n</p><p>The Storehouse is divided from the other parts of the Underdark by the rope netting. The ground at the foot of the netting is trapped with several hidden <a href=\"/wiki/Blast_Mine\" title=\"Blast Mine\">Blast Mines</a>, which can be noticed with a passive perception check. Triggering any of them starts a chain explosion that may eventually destroy the netting and alerts nearby <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minotaur\" title=\"Minotaur\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Minotaur.png/25px-Portrait_Minotaur.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Minotaur.png/38px-Portrait_Minotaur.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Minotaur.png/50px-Portrait_Minotaur.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minotaurs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Minotaur.png/25px-Portrait_Minotaur.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Portrait_Minotaur.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minotaur\" title=\"Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a>. However, it is possible to climb up or descent through a series of jumps onto rocky steps and giant mushroom caps just aside.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Minotaur_hills\">Minotaur hills</span></h3>\n<p>While the Storehouse is free of any enemies, the adjacent territory features three wandering <a href=\"/wiki/Minotaur\" title=\"Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a>, which turn hostile on sight. However, if the party enter the Underdark through the Selûnite outpost, one of them may run to attack the iron portcullis and is then burned to death by the <a href=\"/wiki/Moonstone\" title=\"Moonstone\">Moonstone</a> rays of its magical defence. \n</p><p>Most part of the area (all the way to the barricades before the Selûnite Outpost) is considered as demesne by the <a href=\"/wiki/Myconid\" title=\"Myconid\">Myconids</a> of the nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Ebonlake_Grotto\" title=\"Ebonlake Grotto\">Ebonlake Grotto</a> colony, with the boundaries seen as purplish speckles in the air. When first entering the myconid-controlled area, the party feel the effect of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rapport_Spores_(Condition)\" title=\"Rapport Spores (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Rapport_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rapport_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Rapport_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Rapport_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Rapport_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Rapport_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rapport Spores\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Rapport_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rapport_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ed/Rapport_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rapport_Spores_(Condition)\" title=\"Rapport Spores (Condition)\">Rapport Spores</a> and are engaged into the dialogue with \"Cryptic Voice\" through it, warning them of the Minotaurs ahead. A successful <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Nature Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Nature\" title=\"Nature\">Nature</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> helps to detect the spores, and any party member comments on it regardless of result.\n</p><p>The path leading from the Minotaur Hills down to the Ebonlake Grotto is one of the places where the party might encounter a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bulette\" title=\"Bulette\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png/25px-Portrait_Bulette.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png/38px-Portrait_Bulette.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png/50px-Portrait_Bulette.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bulette\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png/25px-Portrait_Bulette.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bulette\" title=\"Bulette\">Bulette</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_locations\">Related locations</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim_Basement\" title=\"Zhentarim Basement\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zhentarim Basement\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim_Basement\" title=\"Zhentarim Basement\">Zhentarim Basement</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minotaur\" title=\"Minotaur\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Minotaur.png/30px-Portrait_Minotaur.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Minotaur.png/45px-Portrait_Minotaur.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Minotaur.png/60px-Portrait_Minotaur.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minotaur\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Minotaur.png/30px-Portrait_Minotaur.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Portrait_Minotaur.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minotaur\" title=\"Minotaur\">Minotaur</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bulette\" title=\"Bulette\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png/30px-Portrait_Bulette.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png/45px-Portrait_Bulette.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png/60px-Portrait_Bulette.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bulette\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png/30px-Portrait_Bulette.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Portrait_Bulette.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bulette\" title=\"Bulette\">Bulette</a> - possibly</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Loot\">Loot</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Various <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">alchemical</a> resources, <a href=\"/wiki/Ammunition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammunition\">Ammunition</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\">Elixirs</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Valuables\" title=\"Valuables\">Valuables</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thieves%27_Tools\" title=\"Thieves' Tools\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Thieves_Tools_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Thieves%27_Tools\" title=\"Thieves' Tools\">Thieves' Tools</a></span> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit\" title=\"Trap Disarm Toolkit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Trap_Disarm_Toolkit\" title=\"Trap Disarm Toolkit\">Trap Disarm Toolkits</a></span></li>\n<li>Buried chest at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;140&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-120</span></li></ul>\n<p>In the locked and trapped Heavy Chest:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_False_Life\" title=\"Scroll of False Life\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_False_Life\" title=\"Scroll of False Life\">Scroll of False Life</a></span> - 3x</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Scroll of Speak with Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Scroll_of_Speak_With_Dead_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Scroll of Speak with Dead\">Scroll of Speak with Dead</a></span> -2x</li></ul>\n<p>Looted from the Minotaur wielding a weapon:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_the_Unworthy\" title=\"Amulet of the Unworthy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Keepsake_Locket_A_Glowing_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_the_Unworthy\" title=\"Amulet of the Unworthy\">Amulet of the Unworthy</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output